SUMMARY
-------
Native SwiftUI/HIG implementation of the web TripListPage at full panel/chart/
state/string parity. Decomposed (mirrors the gold-standard
Sources/Features/Driving/RouteEfficiencyPage pattern) into a View + @Observable
model + data-source seam + display-boundary formatters + sample data + route
registration. Uses the P3 shared component library (TSChartContainer, TSBarChart,
TSCard, TSGlassPanel, TSEmptyState, TSErrorDisplay, TSPagination, TSSelect, the
typography roles) and the P2 design tokens (Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing /
TSRadius) — no hardcoded colors/typography, no raw web cloning, no WKWebView.
SI values are read straight from the model and converted to the user's unit only
at the render boundary via the shared KMP Units facade (P1/S5).

