DATA SOURCE BINDING (web hook names kept at the Swift call sites)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
  useTrips        ← TripListDataSource.useTrips(vehicleID:limit:offset:start:end:)  (GET /trips?vehicle_id&limit&offset&start&end)
  useSelectedVehicle ← TripListDataSource.loadVehicles()                            (GET /vehicles)
  Bound through @Observable TripListPageModel (no networking in the view; ADR-004).

