PARITY_COVERED=34

All 34 parity items implemented and bound to the @Observable TripListPageModel.
Every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names
(count-interpolated keys carry the {{count}} token, resolved via the established
String(localized:) + replacingOccurrences pattern). loading / empty / success
implemented for the trips source (+ error). a11y: combined accessibility elements
on cards/rows, chart accessibilityLabel, ≥44pt controls, Dynamic Type via Font.TS,
light/dark + increased-contrast via Color.TS dynamic tokens. SI units formatted at
the display boundary only. Adaptive layout (compact iPhone vs. regular macOS/iPad).
Navigation: .trips registered in the route host (TripsRouteRegistration +
TeslaSyncApp routeHostRegistry).

